### TimeEntry - List all
GET http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries

### TimeEntry - Filter by projectName
GET http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries?projectName=React

### TimeEntry - Filter by approvalStatus
GET http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries?approvalStatus=待审批

### TimeEntry - Get by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries/1

### TimeEntry - Create
POST http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "项目 B",
  "description": "开发用户管理",
  "hours": 4,
  "approvalStatus": "待审批"
}

### TimeEntry - Batch Create
POST http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "projectName": "A", "description": "d1", "hours": 2, "approvalStatus": "待审批" },
  { "projectName": "B", "description": "d2", "hours": 3, "approvalStatus": "待审批" }
]

### TimeEntry - Update
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hours": 6, "description": "更新描述" }

### TimeEntry - Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries/1

### TimeEntry - Submit for Approval
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries/1/submit

### TimeEntry - Approve
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries/1/approve

### TimeEntry - Reject
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/time-entries/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "工时填写不规范" }

### User - List all
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users

### User - Filter by username
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users?username=Admin

### User - Filter by role
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users?role=Administrator

### User - Get by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/api/users/1

### User - Create
POST http://localhost:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "NewUser",
  "password": "Pass@word0",
  "roles": ["User"]
}

### User - Update
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": ["ProjectManager"] }

### User - Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/users/1

### User - Login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Administrator", "password": "Pass@word0" }

### Role - List all
GET http://localhost:8000/api/roles

### Role - Get by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/api/roles/1

### Role - Create
POST http://localhost:8000/api/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Developer",
  "permissions": ["TimeSheet.Read", "TimeSheet.Write"]
}

### Role - Update
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/roles/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "permissions": ["TimeSheet.Read", "TimeSheet.Write", "TimeSheet.Export"] }

### Role - Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/roles/3

### Role - Delete Administrator (should return 403)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/roles/1